nd technical background to contribute effectively to software engineering projects in an entry-level capacity.\n\nSKILLS\n- Technical Skills: Python, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, SQL\n- Tools & Technologies: Git, GitHub, VS Code, MySQL, React.js, Node.js\n- Soft Skills: Problem Solving, Team Collaboration, Adaptability, Time Management\n\nEDUCATION\nBachelor of Science in Computer Science\nState University, City, State\nGraduation: May 2024\n- Relevant Coursework: Data Structures & Algorithms, Web Development, Database Management Systems, Software Engineering\n\nPROJECTS\nPersonal Portfolio Website | React, CSS3, GitHub Pages\n- Designed and deployed a responsive personal portfolio showcasing technical projects and skills.\n- Optimized site performance and cross-browser compatibility to enhance user experience.\n\nTask Tracker Application | Python, MySQL\n- Built a dynamic desktop application for tracking daily tasks and managing project deadlines.\n- Designed a secure MySQL database schema to manage user data and persistence.\n\nCERTIFICATIONS\n- Python for Everybody Specialization – Coursera (2023)\n- Responsive Web Design Certification – freeCodeCamp (2023)\n\nLANGUAGES\n- English (Fluent)\n- Hindi (Native)', '2026-07-26 07:14:56'),
