vel engineering role.\n\nEDUCATION\nBachelor of Science in Computer Science | University Name, City, State\nExpected Graduation: May 2025\n• Relevant Coursework: Data Structures & Algorithms, Database Systems, Web Development, Software Engineering\n• Honors/GPA: 3.8/4.0\n\nSKILLS\n• Programming Languages: Python, Java, C++, JavaScript, SQL\n• Web Technologies: HTML5, CSS3, React.js, Node.js\n• Tools & Platforms: Git, GitHub, VS Code, MySQL, Postman\n• Soft Skills: Problem Solving, Team Collaboration, Adaptability, Time Management\n\nPROJECTS\nE-Commerce Web Application | React, Node.js, MongoDB\n• Designed and implemented a responsive full-stack web application featuring user authentication and product filtering.\n• Integrated RESTful APIs to process simulated transactions securely, improving load speed by 20%.\n\nData Visualization Dashboard | Python, Pandas, Streamlit\n• Developed an interactive analytics dashboard to visualize sales trends from large datasets.\n• Processed and cleaned raw CSV data using Pandas to generate dynamic charts for key performance metrics.\n\nCERTIFICATES\n• AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner – Amazon Web Services (2024)\n• Python for Data Science and Machine Learning – Coursera (2023)\n\nLANGUAGES\n• English (Fluent)\n• Hindi (Native)', '2026-07-26 07:22:12'),
