try-level developer.\n\nSKILLS\n- Technical Skills: Python, Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, SQL\n- Tools & Frameworks: Git, GitHub, React.js, VS Code, MySQL\n- Soft Skills: Problem Solving, Team Collaboration, Adaptability, Time Management\n\nEDUCATION\nBachelor of Technology in Computer Science & Engineering\n[University Name], City, State | Graduation Year: 2024\n- Relevant Coursework: Data Structures & Algorithms, Database Systems, Web Development, Software Engineering\n\nPROJECTS\nE-Commerce Web Application | Tech Stack: React.js, Node.js, MongoDB\n- Developed a responsive full-stack e-commerce application allowing users to browse products and manage a shopping cart.\n- Implemented user authentication and RESTful APIs to handle product data securely.\n\nPortfolio Website | Tech Stack: HTML, CSS, JavaScript\n- Designed and deployed a personal portfolio website to showcase academic projects and skills.\n- Optimized layout for mobile responsiveness and fast page loading times.\n\nCERTIFICATES\n- Full Stack Web Development Certificate – Coursera / Udemy\n- Python for Data Science Certificate – NPTEL / IBM\n\nLANGUAGES\n- English (Fluent)\n- Hindi (Native)', '2026-07-26 07:22:22'),
