(26, 36, 10, 'Candidate name is clearly stated at the top of the document.', 'Resume is incomplete and contains only a name.\nMissing essential contact information (email, phone, LinkedIn, location).\nLacks a professional summary, education, work experience, and skills sections.\nNo measurable achievements, quantifiable results, or industry keywords present.', 'Core Technical Skills (e.g., Python, Java, SQL, JavaScript)\nSoft Skills (e.g., Team Collaboration, Problem Solving, Communication)\nTools & Platforms (e.g., Git, Microsoft Excel, AWS, JIRA)', 'Provide full contact details (email, phone number, location, and LinkedIn profile).\nAdd a compelling Professional Summary highlighting your background and career goals.\nInclude an Education section with degree, university name, and graduation year.\nDetail your Work Experience or Projects using bullet points starting with strong action verbs.\nAdd a dedicated Skills section with relevant keywords tailored to your target job descriptions.', 'Software Engineer\nData Analyst\nBusiness Analyst\nIT Associate', 'Can you walk me through your background and professional journey?\nWhat key projects or technical experiences have you worked on?\nWhat specific job role and technologies are you targeting?', 'SANCHITA SURESH PATIL\nCity, State | Phone: (123) 456-7890 | Email: sanchita.patil@email.com | LinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/sanchitapatil | Portfolio: github.com/sanchitapatil\n\nPROFESSIONAL SUMMARY\nDetail-oriented and motivated professional with a strong foundation in problem-solving and modern technology stacks. Seeking to leverage analytical and technical expertise to contribute effectively to a dynamic team in an entry-to-mid-level engineering or analytical role.\n\nTECHNICAL SKILLS\n- Programming Languages: Python, Java, SQL, JavaScript\n- Web Technologies: HTML5, CSS3, React, Node.js\n- Databases & Tools: MySQL, PostgreSQL, Git, VS Code, JIRA\n- Concepts: Object-Oriented Programming (OOP), Data Structures, SDLC\n\nWORK EXPERIENCE / PROJECTS\nProject Title | Technologies Used (e.g., Python, SQL, React)\n- Developed a responsive web application that optimized user workflow and reduced load times by 20%.\n- Integrated RESTful APIs to display real-time data feeds, enhancing user engagement and interface responsiveness.\n- Implemented relational database schemas using SQL, ensuring data integrity and query performance optimization.\n\nEDUCATION\nBachelor of Science / Technology in Computer Science or Related Field\nUniversity Name, City, State | Graduation Year: 202X\n- Relevant Coursework: Data Structures, Database Management Systems, Software Engineering\n\nCERTIFICATIONS\n- Relevant Technical Certification (e.g., AWS Certified Cloud Practitioner / Python Certification)', '2026-07-26 22:19:14'),
(27, 37, 75, 'Resume contains technical skills\nProjects and education information available\nGood candidate profile structure', 'Add measurable achievements\nImprove keyword optimization', 'Cloud Computing\nAdvanced Git\nDatabase optimization', 'Add certifications\nAdd more project details\nUse ATS friendly keywords', 'Software Developer\nWeb Developer\nJunior Programmer\nFull Stack Developer', 'Explain your major project\nWhat technologies did you use?\nWhat challenges did you face?', '\r\n\r\nProfessional Resume\r\n\r\nAdd stronger summary,\r\ntechnical skills,\r\nprojects and achievements\r\nfor better ATS performance.\r\n\r\n', '2026-07-26 22:19:28'),
